  "statement": "# Ballast Yard — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nManipulate a small industrial yard so a heavy moving object can traverse it safely, then commit to the release and observe the consequence.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA compact physics or construction puzzle with preparation, execution, distinct failure causes, recovery, and successful delivery.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose the exact construction verbs, yard geometry, object physics, puzzle sequence, and feedback.\n"
